# Skill: Run AI Evals (@RunEvals)

When invoked with `@RunEvals`, execute the following procedure:
1. Run the local evaluation runner: `npm run eval`.
2. Parse the generated report from `evals/output/report.json`.
3. Format a markdown scorecard displaying:
   - Total test cases evaluated
   - Recall@k Score
   - Grounding Accuracy %
   - Schema Validation Success Rate %
   - p95 Latency (ms) & Estimated USD Cost
4. Flag any regressed prompt test cases that scored lower than previous runs.
